- [Stage 2: Implementing a large migration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/large-migration-guide/stage2.md)
- [About the migration strategies](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/large-migration-guide/migration-strategies.md)
- [Resources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/large-migration-guide/resources.md)
